<!--
# Documentation
## Labels
Labels show on the Disposition UI.
Descriptor shows up as positiveLabel if the score is positive, negativeLabel if negative.
If score is zero, the label becomes empty.
If there is no available label per the score, the Descriptor is not shown up on the Disposition UI.

## Descriptions
Descriptions show up as the tooltip for Descriptors and Personality Effect description.
positiveDescription: Shows up if positively aligned 
negativeDescription: Shows up if negatively aligned 
-->

